4
00:01:22,519 --> 00:01:24,920
All the poetry has been compiled into a book.

5
00:01:25,319 --> 00:01:28,040
You can buy it at Huayue Tower and Yun Bookshop.

6
00:01:28,680 --> 00:01:29,799
The top ten

7
00:01:29,799 --> 00:01:30,920
in the Xingyun Ranking

8
00:01:31,200 --> 00:01:33,599
will enter the final exam of Xingyun.

9
00:01:33,799 --> 00:01:35,480
Praise the prosperity of the Yun State.

10
00:01:36,480 --> 00:01:39,079
What is the final exam of Xingyun?

11
00:01:39,799 --> 00:01:41,000
Why is it so complicated?

12
00:01:41,599 --> 00:01:43,799
I just want to see Mr. Cheng's play.

13
00:01:44,400 --> 00:01:46,879
It should be asking us to buy his books.

14
00:01:56,439 --> 00:01:57,920
It's really for buying books.

15
00:01:58,480 --> 00:01:59,840
Quick, before she buys them all.

16
00:02:00,079 --> 00:02:01,799
Right, she really could do this.

17
00:02:06,879 --> 00:02:07,680
So many.

18
00:02:07,719 --> 00:02:09,080
Quick, quick, quick, let's go.

19
00:02:30,639 --> 00:02:31,280
My lady,

20
00:02:32,080 --> 00:02:33,360
you're up this late,

21
00:02:33,840 --> 00:02:34,919
sharpening your sword.

22
00:02:35,520 --> 00:02:37,680
Planning to use it on me?

23
00:02:39,120 --> 00:02:39,639
No.

24
00:02:49,840 --> 00:02:50,639
Then,

25
00:02:51,919 --> 00:02:53,919
are you going to fight with Bai Yanliang?

26
00:02:55,840 --> 00:02:57,280
Why fight in the middle of the night?

27
00:02:57,520 --> 00:02:59,360
Why are you up at this hour?

28
00:03:01,319 --> 00:03:02,680
You went out with Bai Yanliang,

29
00:03:03,120 --> 00:03:04,360
and you didn't say a word when you came back.

30
00:03:05,039 --> 00:03:06,240
I'm your husband.

31
00:03:06,240 --> 00:03:07,400
I'm just concerned about you.

32
00:03:11,080 --> 00:03:12,000
What's going on?

33
00:03:16,159 --> 00:03:17,000
I...

34
00:03:19,919 --> 00:03:20,840
I miss my mother.

35
00:03:27,039 --> 00:03:28,800
That's a unique way

36
00:03:29,080 --> 00:03:30,520
of showing your affection.

37
00:03:31,840 --> 00:03:32,639
So,

38
00:03:33,120 --> 00:03:35,120
she got hurt because she saved someone.

39
00:03:36,759 --> 00:03:37,520
I knew it.

40
00:03:38,479 --> 00:03:40,599
My mother never missed a target.

41
00:03:44,280 --> 00:03:46,520
Could it be Bai Yanliang?

42
00:03:49,240 --> 00:03:50,159
What a coincidence.

43
00:03:52,639 --> 00:03:53,719
So,

44
00:03:54,039 --> 00:03:55,520
Bai Yanliang is here to repay the favor.

45
00:03:55,879 --> 00:03:57,439
What does it have to do with me?

46
00:03:57,680 --> 00:03:58,960
He couldn't marry me.

47
00:03:59,879 --> 00:04:00,680
He said

48
00:04:01,159 --> 00:04:02,120
he was afraid you would hurt me.

49
00:04:02,240 --> 00:04:02,960
Hurt you?

50
00:04:05,680 --> 00:04:07,879
Who dares? I don't.

51
00:04:15,280 --> 00:04:15,879
My dear,

52
00:04:17,000 --> 00:04:17,759
what kind of person

53
00:04:17,959 --> 00:04:19,279
is your mother?

54
00:04:22,079 --> 00:04:23,319
My mother

55
00:04:23,519 --> 00:04:25,439
is the best escort in the world.

56
00:04:38,040 --> 00:04:39,399
But the escorts of our Su family

57
00:04:39,600 --> 00:04:40,839
protect people, not hurt them.

58
00:04:44,439 --> 00:04:45,199
You should

59
00:04:45,480 --> 00:04:47,040
have your own things to do.

60
00:04:49,879 --> 00:04:51,240
Things to do?

61
00:05:02,839 --> 00:05:03,319
So,

62
00:05:04,079 --> 00:05:06,079
I have to protect the escort agency for my mother.

63
00:05:06,519 --> 00:05:07,519
I can't let her down.

64
00:05:11,959 --> 00:05:14,160
Your mother would be proud of you.

65
00:05:17,560 --> 00:05:18,319
Thank you

66
00:05:20,160 --> 00:05:21,079
for listening to me.

67
00:05:43,240 --> 00:05:44,639
Cheng is so talented.

68
00:05:44,639 --> 00:05:45,040
I want one too.

69
00:05:45,040 --> 00:05:46,199
Give me two.

70
00:05:46,199 --> 00:05:46,759
Yicheng,

71
00:05:47,720 --> 00:05:49,000
what's going on at the Huayue Pavilion?

72
00:05:49,439 --> 00:05:51,399
Meng Feifei said this is what happens

73
00:05:51,800 --> 00:05:52,800
