74
00:05:53,000 --> 00:05:54,279
Don't grab, there's enough for everyone.

75
00:05:55,240 --> 00:05:56,120
What else did she say?

76
00:05:56,720 --> 00:05:57,600
She asked me to take you through the back door.

77
00:05:58,079 --> 00:05:58,839
Why?

78
00:05:59,319 --> 00:05:59,839
Look at him.

79
00:06:01,800 --> 00:06:02,759
What's so good about Cheng Qi?

80
00:06:03,279 --> 00:06:04,639
Cheng Qi is the best.

81
00:06:04,680 --> 00:06:06,920
Only ignorant women like you

82
00:06:06,920 --> 00:06:07,439
would appreciate Cheng Qi.

83
00:06:08,000 --> 00:06:09,560
Mr. Ling is the best.

84
00:06:12,040 --> 00:06:12,920
When Mr. Cheng comes,

85
00:06:13,279 --> 00:06:14,519
he will make you and your Mr. Ling

86
00:06:14,639 --> 00:06:15,319
feel ashamed.

87
00:06:19,879 --> 00:06:21,720
Mr. Ling won't hang around here

88
00:06:21,920 --> 00:06:23,560
like Cheng Qi.

89
00:06:23,800 --> 00:06:25,399
That's not what a gentleman would do.

90
00:06:26,480 --> 00:06:27,199
Guys,

91
00:06:27,319 --> 00:06:28,800
we can't let him bully Cheng.

92
00:06:29,120 --> 00:06:29,399
Go!

93
00:06:29,399 --> 00:06:29,879
Beat him!

94
00:06:30,040 --> 00:06:31,279
Right.

95
00:06:31,639 --> 00:06:32,279
What are you doing?

96
00:06:32,560 --> 00:06:33,360
You deserve this for talking nonsense.

97
00:06:33,360 --> 00:06:34,000
You deserve this for talking nonsense.

98
00:06:34,000 --> 00:06:34,680
Don't hit his face.

99
00:06:35,120 --> 00:06:36,279
You deserve this for talking nonsense.

100
00:06:36,279 --> 00:06:37,439
This is too crazy.

101
00:06:38,040 --> 00:06:39,920
Meng Feifei really is a prophet.

102
00:06:40,399 --> 00:06:40,639
Go.

103
00:06:40,839 --> 00:06:41,360
Go through the back door.

104
00:06:56,480 --> 00:06:58,639
These are all from the girls who admire you.

105
00:06:58,680 --> 00:07:00,079
They prepared for your final exam.

106
00:07:00,759 --> 00:07:01,839
Why?

107
00:07:02,279 --> 00:07:05,160
You are the top of the Starry Cloud Conference.

108
00:07:05,360 --> 00:07:06,240
Thanks to you,

109
00:07:06,480 --> 00:07:07,920
the business of our Huayue Tower

110
00:07:08,079 --> 00:07:09,120
is getting better and better.

111
00:07:09,680 --> 00:07:10,879
Can I get a discount on my drinks?

112
00:07:12,360 --> 00:07:13,120
No.

113
00:07:15,360 --> 00:07:17,439
But your drinks for this month

114
00:07:17,639 --> 00:07:18,639
have been paid for.

115
00:08:06,000 --> 00:08:06,680
Handsome,

116
00:08:06,680 --> 00:08:09,240
dashing, well-dressed, and talented.

117
00:08:13,879 --> 00:08:14,360
My Lord.

118
00:08:15,639 --> 00:08:16,319
Just say it.

119
00:08:16,800 --> 00:08:17,720
Bai Yanli is missing.

120
00:08:18,639 --> 00:08:19,399
I let him go.

121
00:08:20,160 --> 00:08:21,040
Everyone has their own aspirations.

122
00:08:21,399 --> 00:08:23,360
He must have found what he wants to do.

123
00:08:24,040 --> 00:08:25,079
He should have left long ago.

124
00:08:25,439 --> 00:08:26,160
He's just showing off.

125
00:08:26,639 --> 00:08:27,560
He's just showing off to us.

126
00:08:27,759 --> 00:08:29,000
He works tirelessly for no pay.

127
00:08:29,079 --> 00:08:30,240
He works himself to the bone for no life.

128
00:08:30,480 --> 00:08:31,759
You two are shameless!

129
00:08:32,039 --> 00:08:32,600
Go to work!

130
00:08:33,080 --> 00:08:34,440
My Lord, there are no new orders

131
00:08:34,440 --> 00:08:35,600
in and around the city.

132
00:08:35,639 --> 00:08:37,039
We only have these few left.

133
00:08:37,919 --> 00:08:38,679
I'll figure something out.

134
00:08:39,120 --> 00:08:39,679
While you have the time,

135
00:08:39,840 --> 00:08:42,000
you two should go prepare the armor and weapons.

136
00:08:47,320 --> 00:08:48,080
Gong Xi, Fatt Choy.

137
00:08:48,399 --> 00:08:49,200
Come and help!

138
00:08:50,120 --> 00:08:50,559
Hurry up!

139
00:08:51,840 --> 00:08:53,159
Hurry up!

140
00:08:53,159 --> 00:08:54,240
Hurry up!

141
00:08:54,440 --> 00:08:55,639
Hold it. I'll go first.

142
00:08:56,639 --> 00:08:58,240
Cheng Yicheng, hold it. Use your strength.

143
00:08:58,240 --> 00:08:59,600
Cheng Yicheng, use your strength.

144
00:09:05,320 --> 00:09:06,120
Let's go back.

145
00:09:10,759 --> 00:09:11,080
Go.

146
00:09:30,840 --> 00:09:31,679
What happened?

147
00:09:35,240 --> 00:09:36,480
I'm afraid we can't

148
00:09:36,480 --> 00:09:37,679
stay in the Huanyue Tower anymore.

149
00:09:41,039 --> 00:09:42,320
A thief broke into my room.

150
00:09:43,399 --> 00:09:44,039
No way.

151
00:09:44,399 --> 00:09:45,279
In broad daylight,

152
00:09:45,279 --> 00:09:46,120
who's that bold?

153
00:09:46,440 --> 00:09:47,600
How would I know?

154
00:09:48,639 --> 00:09:49,840
And there are always

155
00:09:50,200 --> 00:09:51,519
so many people outside my door.

156
00:09:51,960 --> 00:09:53,639
I can't focus on writing lyrics.

157
00:09:55,960 --> 00:09:56,519
My lady,

158
00:09:58,000 --> 00:09:59,159
you saw today

159
00:09:59,480 --> 00:10:01,159
so many girls chasing me.

160
00:10:02,320 --> 00:10:04,159
I'll get rid of them.

161
00:10:04,720 --> 00:10:05,639
No need.

162
00:10:07,039 --> 00:10:08,159
So what do you want?

163
00:10:08,320 --> 00:10:08,720
Tell me.

164
00:10:13,200 --> 00:10:14,480
I want to go back to the Escort Agency to write lyrics.

165
00:10:14,559 --> 00:10:14,919
No.

166
00:10:15,720 --> 00:10:17,720
With all these people blocking the entrance,

167
00:10:17,720 --> 00:10:18,759
how can we take on any more escort missions?

168
00:10:20,080 --> 00:10:21,919
My lady, I don't care.

169
00:10:22,279 --> 00:10:23,879
I can't stay at the Huayue Tower anymore.

170
00:10:25,720 --> 00:10:26,240
And,

171
00:10:26,679 --> 00:10:28,639
when Yicheng and I fled, we were too hasty.

172
00:10:28,720 --> 00:10:30,200
We didn't bring a lot of things.

173
00:10:30,799 --> 00:10:31,799
You can take it as escorting me.

174
00:10:31,919 --> 00:10:32,679
Bring them back for me.

175
00:10:42,279 --> 00:10:43,799
Su Shi Escort Agency never gives credit.

176
00:10:45,440 --> 00:10:46,519
Is the business

177
00:10:46,919 --> 00:10:48,080
not going well recently?

178
00:10:48,320 --> 00:10:49,720
You even have to calculate with your husband.

179
00:10:50,559 --> 00:10:51,600
Look at the yard.

180
00:10:51,720 --> 00:10:52,759
It's full of escort vehicles.

181
00:10:52,759 --> 00:10:53,440
How can it be good?

182
00:10:54,039 --> 00:10:55,639
Even so, you still want to come back to write lyrics.

183
00:10:56,240 --> 00:10:57,639
Your girls have nothing to do,

184
00:10:57,799 --> 00:10:59,840
and they mess up the last business of the escort agency.

185
00:11:04,840 --> 00:11:07,279
It's time for me to show my skills.

186
00:11:10,720 --> 00:11:11,879
What skills do you have?

187
00:11:17,240 --> 00:11:19,000
If you want to bring business to the escort agency,

188
00:11:19,240 --> 00:11:20,600
why are you in my Moon God Pavilion?

189
00:11:21,639 --> 00:11:23,519
People are blocking me at the entrance of the escort agency.

190
00:11:23,519 --> 00:11:25,080
My wife doesn't like it.

191
00:11:25,279 --> 00:11:26,879
You didn't ask me if I like it.

192
00:11:27,320 --> 00:11:29,519
I'm just building up the reputation of the Moon God Pavilion.

193
00:11:30,039 --> 00:11:30,600
Mr. Meng,

194
00:11:31,360 --> 00:11:32,480
I've heard recently

195
00:11:32,480 --> 00:11:33,679
that the Moon God Pavilion

196
00:11:34,000 --> 00:11:36,200
has sold a lot of things related to me.

197
00:11:41,200 --> 00:11:42,240
I want to make some peripheral products.

198
00:11:42,480 --> 00:11:43,159
You take 70%, I take 30%.

199
00:11:43,519 --> 00:11:45,120
I'll also publish a novel about you and Su Biao.

200
00:11:45,279 --> 00:11:45,960
A novel?

201
00:11:47,639 --> 00:11:48,600
What novel?

202
00:11:49,399 --> 00:11:50,440
It's about your daily life.

203
00:11:50,559 --> 00:11:51,440
I don't have time for that.

204
00:11:51,919 --> 00:11:54,120
Don't worry. I've found someone.

205
00:11:57,200 --> 00:11:58,799
Mr. Cheng,

206
00:11:59,200 --> 00:11:59,639
30%.

207
00:12:01,879 --> 00:12:04,080
Since you are in full charge,

208
00:12:04,399 --> 00:12:05,840
I'll just give you 10%.

209
00:12:06,159 --> 00:12:06,480
Okay.

210
00:12:06,840 --> 00:12:07,559
It's a deal.

211
00:12:07,799 --> 00:12:08,960
Deal.

212
00:12:09,720 --> 00:12:10,360
Goodbye.

213
00:12:55,159 --> 00:12:56,279
What are they doing here?

214
00:12:56,399 --> 00:12:57,039
To escort.

215
00:12:57,440 --> 00:12:58,919
I thought they were here to rob.

216
00:13:04,519 --> 00:13:06,039
They are all escorts from the city.

217
00:13:06,759 --> 00:13:07,480
Is it possible that

218
00:13:08,200 --> 00:13:09,480
my uncle went out to find a job?

219
00:13:10,159 --> 00:13:11,519
It has nothing to do with him.

220
00:13:12,039 --> 00:13:13,720
These are all escort orders brought by my son-in-law.

221
00:13:28,120 --> 00:13:29,000
You can go to escort first.

222
00:13:29,159 --> 00:13:29,679
I'll be right back.

223
00:13:38,600 --> 00:13:39,200
This way, please.

224
00:13:51,759 --> 00:13:52,799
So handsome!

225
00:13:53,960 --> 00:13:54,559
Take a look.

226
00:13:54,720 --> 00:13:56,000
All are fine wine.

227
00:13:58,279 --> 00:13:59,159
Please take a look.

228
00:13:59,759 --> 00:14:00,279
Thank you.

229
00:14:08,399 --> 00:14:08,960
How's that?

230
00:14:09,879 --> 00:14:11,440
I'm good at matchmaking, right?

231
00:14:11,840 --> 00:14:13,720
Mr. Cheng is indeed a reliable man.

232
00:14:15,399 --> 00:14:17,039
He should be preparing for the Starry Night Gala,

233
00:14:17,360 --> 00:14:18,919
instead of wasting time here.

234
00:14:19,559 --> 00:14:20,440
I have to take him back.

235
00:14:22,120 --> 00:14:23,639
He's doing this for you.

236
00:14:24,279 --> 00:14:25,600
He said the business of the Escort Agency is not good,

237
00:14:25,879 --> 00:14:26,960
so he came here to find business.

238
00:14:29,399 --> 00:14:30,799
I was just joking with him.

239
00:14:31,200 --> 00:14:32,159
It's not that serious.

240
00:14:32,960 --> 00:14:35,639
Only you know that.

241
00:14:37,320 --> 00:14:38,600
Don't be fooled by his usual laughter.

242
00:14:38,919 --> 00:14:39,440
In his heart,

243
00:14:39,559 --> 00:14:41,639
he knows what is important.

244
00:14:43,639 --> 00:14:45,080
Is he as good as you say?

245
00:14:46,240 --> 00:14:47,480
I like you.

246
00:14:47,799 --> 00:14:49,360
Are you married?

247
00:14:49,519 --> 00:14:51,360
Would you like to marry me?

248
00:14:53,039 --> 00:14:54,480
Thank you for your love.

249
00:14:54,720 --> 00:14:55,759
I'm already married.

250
00:14:56,519 --> 00:14:58,279
She is the head of the Su's Escort Agency.

251
00:15:02,399 --> 00:15:03,320
She is my wife.

252
00:15:05,639 --> 00:15:06,360
Liar!

253
00:15:08,080 --> 00:15:09,080
He's a liar!

254
00:15:09,120 --> 00:15:10,240
I don't want to stay here.

255
00:15:10,240 --> 00:15:11,519
Go, he's a liar!

256
00:15:12,080 --> 00:15:12,879
Liar!

257
00:15:12,879 --> 00:15:13,679
I'm not afraid of being cheated.

258
00:15:17,240 --> 00:15:18,080
How's that?

259
00:15:18,320 --> 00:15:19,559
Cheng Qi is really good, isn't he?

260
00:15:41,759 --> 00:15:42,279
Thank you.

261
00:15:43,759 --> 00:15:45,720
Someone broke into Cheng Qi's room and took things.

262
00:15:46,399 --> 00:15:47,759
Did he lose anything important?

263
00:15:48,360 --> 00:15:50,000
He doesn't have anything valuable.

264
00:15:50,360 --> 00:15:53,000
It's just a woman who wants to be a thief.

265
00:15:54,840 --> 00:15:55,679
In that case,

266
00:15:56,200 --> 00:15:56,679
Ying,

267
00:15:57,159 --> 00:15:57,919
arrange for someone

268
00:15:57,960 --> 00:15:59,360
to prepare the study in the courtyard.

269
00:15:59,720 --> 00:16:02,120
My lady, are you planning to have him stay there?

270
00:16:04,679 --> 00:16:06,320
I'll go later.

271
00:16:07,000 --> 00:16:07,919
For now,

272
00:16:08,480 --> 00:16:09,879
I'll stay with you.

273
00:16:10,960 --> 00:16:12,720
What's the matter? Why so hesitant?

274
00:16:14,120 --> 00:16:15,080
The Young Master has arrived,

275
00:16:16,159 --> 00:16:16,879
with whom?

276
00:16:17,279 --> 00:16:18,000
Mr. Ling,

277
00:16:18,120 --> 00:16:19,840
and some other noble young men.

278
00:16:21,960 --> 00:16:23,000
And...

279
00:16:24,240 --> 00:16:25,840
His Lordship wants to see you.

280
00:16:30,000 --> 00:16:31,159
I see.

281
00:16:34,720 --> 00:16:35,720
As long as I'm here,

282
00:16:35,960 --> 00:16:36,720
you can rest assured

283
00:16:36,919 --> 00:16:37,840
about the poetry meeting.

284
00:16:38,080 --> 00:16:39,080
You're right.

285
00:16:39,159 --> 00:16:40,159
You're right.

286
00:16:42,440 --> 00:16:42,960
My lord,

287
00:16:45,480 --> 00:16:46,440
Mr. Ling has been

288
00:16:46,759 --> 00:16:47,639
is Mr. Ling.

289
00:16:50,960 --> 00:16:52,000
Thank you, Lord Zhang.

290
00:16:54,240 --> 00:16:55,200
Thank you, Miss.

291
00:17:00,720 --> 00:17:01,240
What?

292
00:17:01,639 --> 00:17:03,360
Do I need to repeat it?

293
00:17:04,240 --> 00:17:04,799
Brother.

294
00:17:05,200 --> 00:17:07,160
The rules have been announced.

295
00:17:07,559 --> 00:17:09,200
Lord Yue will also attend.

296
00:17:10,640 --> 00:17:12,079
I dare not decide

297
00:17:12,640 --> 00:17:13,839
who will be the champion.

298
00:17:18,799 --> 00:17:19,799
Mr. Ling, don't worry.

299
00:17:20,839 --> 00:17:21,720
If she can't decide,

300
00:17:22,079 --> 00:17:23,079
I'll decide for you.

301
00:17:25,039 --> 00:17:27,400
I toast to Lord Zhang.

302
00:17:41,440 --> 00:17:42,960
Why get married so early?

303
00:17:42,960 --> 00:17:45,160
Yeah, why marry a bodyguard?

304
00:17:45,799 --> 00:17:47,440
I wanted to marry Cheng.

305
00:17:48,160 --> 00:17:49,960
Do you really have to do this to him?

306
00:17:50,240 --> 00:17:51,039
You know

307
00:17:51,480 --> 00:17:53,599
how much effort we've put in

308
00:17:53,880 --> 00:17:54,759
to help Cheng become the top scholar.

309
00:17:56,079 --> 00:17:57,640
But it's normal for a man like him

310
00:17:58,000 --> 00:17:59,640
to get married at an early age.

311
00:18:00,359 --> 00:18:03,200
But he didn't marry a noble lady

312
00:18:03,200 --> 00:18:04,640
or a refined lady.

313
00:18:04,839 --> 00:18:06,240
He married a bodyguard

314
00:18:06,599 --> 00:18:07,839
and even lived in her house.

315
00:18:08,960 --> 00:18:09,799
What's wrong with a bodyguard?

316
00:18:10,799 --> 00:18:12,440
A female bodyguard.

317
00:18:12,680 --> 00:18:14,000
She must be vulgar.

318
00:18:20,119 --> 00:18:20,720
It seems to be her.

319
00:18:20,720 --> 00:18:22,000
Who are you talking about?

320
00:18:28,640 --> 00:18:30,599
You took Cheng Qi away.

321
00:18:31,039 --> 00:18:31,960
You don't need to be like this.

322
00:18:33,160 --> 00:18:34,960
If you are sensible, you should divorce with him.

323
00:18:34,960 --> 00:18:36,119
Don't delay his future.

324
00:18:38,400 --> 00:18:41,079
I'm just a vulgar female escort.

325
00:18:41,559 --> 00:18:42,880
Can I listen to you?

326
00:18:43,359 --> 00:18:44,119
Besides,

327
00:18:44,759 --> 00:18:47,440
if you just like Cheng Qi's lyrics and picture books,

328
00:18:48,359 --> 00:18:49,480
who he marries

329
00:18:49,960 --> 00:18:51,759
has nothing to do with you.

330
00:19:03,240 --> 00:19:05,319
Without me, Cheng Qi is nothing.

331
00:19:05,519 --> 00:19:07,680
Only we can make him on the Star List.

332
00:19:14,440 --> 00:19:15,319
What's wrong with being an escort?

333
00:19:16,240 --> 00:19:17,839
Is it not worthy to be with Cheng Qi?

334
00:19:21,400 --> 00:19:23,119
I even wanted to help him take things home.

335
00:19:33,240 --> 00:19:33,640
What?

336
00:19:34,079 --> 00:19:35,519
Dare Cheng Qi make you feel wronged?

337
00:19:36,039 --> 00:19:37,079
No.

338
00:19:37,279 --> 00:19:38,559
It's those people outside the building.

339
00:19:38,880 --> 00:19:41,160
They said I was vulgar and unbearable.

340
00:19:41,680 --> 00:19:43,400
The girl who put up the notice, right?

341
00:19:44,240 --> 00:19:45,440
Ms. Li said

342
00:19:45,519 --> 00:19:47,279
she hid in Cheng Qi's wardrobe

343
00:19:47,480 --> 00:19:48,680
and scared him.

344
00:19:49,079 --> 00:19:50,200
In the wardrobe?

345
00:19:50,519 --> 00:19:51,720
Is she okay?

346
00:19:52,680 --> 00:19:53,599
You don't understand.

347
00:19:53,799 --> 00:19:54,920
She regards Cheng Qi

348
00:19:54,920 --> 00:19:56,400
as her future husband,

349
00:19:56,400 --> 00:19:57,759
so she spent a lot of money

350
00:19:57,880 --> 00:19:59,359
to buy his songbooks.

351
00:20:00,480 --> 00:20:01,880
What about others?

352
00:20:01,960 --> 00:20:02,799
They think so?

353
00:20:04,720 --> 00:20:05,880
Probably.

354
00:20:07,680 --> 00:20:08,759
So what?

355
00:20:09,200 --> 00:20:10,319
Why did you scold me?

356
00:20:11,440 --> 00:20:12,920
Put your legs down.

357
00:20:13,119 --> 00:20:14,559
You are Cheng Qi's wife.

358
00:20:14,680 --> 00:20:16,039
You said it has nothing to do with you.

359
00:20:19,839 --> 00:20:21,799
Cheng Qi took an order from the Escort Agency.

360
00:20:22,759 --> 00:20:23,440
Do you think

361
00:20:23,799 --> 00:20:25,759
he really treats me as his wife?

362
00:20:25,759 --> 00:20:26,240
Wait.

363
00:20:27,000 --> 00:20:28,480
He took orders from the escort agency?

364
00:20:28,519 --> 00:20:30,279
Didn't he gift ink at Moon God Pavilion?

365
00:20:51,000 --> 00:20:51,559
Jiaojiao,

366
00:20:52,079 --> 00:20:53,480
as your bestie,

367
00:20:53,799 --> 00:20:54,599
let me give you some advice.

368
00:20:55,279 --> 00:20:57,279
A woman should dress up for the one she loves.

369
00:21:01,039 --> 00:21:01,680
What does that mean?

370
00:21:03,319 --> 00:21:04,240
It means

371
00:21:04,319 --> 00:21:06,519
as the wife of a talented man,

372
00:21:06,519 --> 00:21:07,960
you should learn

373
00:21:08,119 --> 00:21:09,160
to learn how to dress up.

374
00:21:11,119 --> 00:21:12,319
You also think I'm not good enough for him.

375
00:21:13,279 --> 00:21:15,000
I didn't mean that.

376
00:21:15,160 --> 00:21:16,079
Cheng Qi is now

377
00:21:16,079 --> 00:21:18,160
a hot candidate for the top scholar.

378
00:21:18,440 --> 00:21:20,680
He can't avoid attending some elegant banquets.

379
00:21:20,960 --> 00:21:23,839
Are you going to wear this escort suit?

380
00:21:24,599 --> 00:21:25,519
If I have to go,

381
00:21:25,799 --> 00:21:27,200
you can dress me up.

382
00:21:27,359 --> 00:21:29,039
I can't be with you every day.

383
00:21:29,319 --> 00:21:30,599
Every day, Cheng Qi

384
00:21:30,599 --> 00:21:32,079
around him every day.

385
00:21:32,839 --> 00:21:34,599
You'd better learn it yourself.

386
00:21:35,319 --> 00:21:36,640
If he falls in love

387
00:21:36,640 --> 00:21:38,160
with some lady one day,

388
00:21:38,240 --> 00:21:39,279
it'll be too late.

389
00:21:54,200 --> 00:21:55,279
You've managed some merchants,

390
00:21:55,799 --> 00:21:57,079
and you don't know who you are.

391
00:21:58,000 --> 00:21:59,039
How dare you disobey my order!

392
00:22:02,680 --> 00:22:03,519
Calm down, brother.

393
00:22:04,039 --> 00:22:04,799
Father said

394
00:22:05,200 --> 00:22:06,400
the emperor loves poetry.

395
00:22:07,079 --> 00:22:08,599
If Mr. Ling is excellent,

396
00:22:08,759 --> 00:22:09,880
he'll be the champion.

397
00:22:10,680 --> 00:22:11,440
Otherwise,

398
00:22:11,799 --> 00:22:13,039
he'll anger the Emperor.

399
00:22:14,000 --> 00:22:14,680
I'm afraid

400
00:22:15,240 --> 00:22:16,480
even father can't protect himself.

401
00:22:17,200 --> 00:22:18,519
So I dare not promise.

402
00:22:18,880 --> 00:22:20,160
Don't threaten me with the Emperor.

403
00:22:21,359 --> 00:22:22,559
I know all your tricks.

404
00:22:22,839 --> 00:22:23,960
You just want to embarrass me

405
00:22:25,119 --> 00:22:26,880
in front of others.

406
00:22:28,039 --> 00:22:29,240
I don't have time for this.

407
00:22:29,759 --> 00:22:30,480
You must

408
00:22:30,920 --> 00:22:31,920
make this work,

409
00:22:32,079 --> 00:22:32,880
no matter what.

410
00:22:33,799 --> 00:22:34,599
Brother, calm down.

411
00:22:35,240 --> 00:22:36,319
I'll talk to father.

412
00:22:36,559 --> 00:22:37,359
He'll handle it.

413
00:22:48,079 --> 00:22:49,079
Later, I'll have Mr. Li

414
00:22:49,480 --> 00:22:51,119
wipe out Mr. Ling's recent debts.

415
00:22:52,440 --> 00:22:53,839
That's a lot of money.

416
00:22:55,359 --> 00:22:56,759
Are you also trying to make me look bad?

417
00:22:57,759 --> 00:22:58,599
I dare not.

418
00:22:58,680 --> 00:22:59,279
Miss Zhang,

419
00:23:03,680 --> 00:23:05,160
what brings Mr. Cheng here?

420
00:23:06,319 --> 00:23:06,880
Actually,

421
00:23:07,680 --> 00:23:09,240
I received your support and help

422
00:23:09,480 --> 00:23:11,880
at the Starry Night Gala.

423
00:23:12,160 --> 00:23:13,319
I left in a hurry last time,

424
00:23:13,640 --> 00:23:14,920
so I came to express my gratitude.

425
00:23:16,960 --> 00:23:18,359
I'm not available today.

426
00:23:19,880 --> 00:23:22,079
Please come another day.

427
00:23:24,599 --> 00:23:25,400
If that's the case,

428
00:23:25,759 --> 00:23:26,920
please give these scrolls of poetry and music

429
00:23:27,119 --> 00:23:29,279
to my lady.

430
00:23:29,720 --> 00:23:30,440
It's a token of my appreciation.

431
00:23:31,279 --> 00:23:31,799
Farewell.

432
00:23:32,440 --> 00:23:33,279
Let him in.

433
00:23:34,440 --> 00:23:35,599
Bring a few more pots of wine.

434
00:23:36,200 --> 00:23:37,000
Yes, my lady.

435
00:23:38,000 --> 00:23:38,799
Please, sir.

436
00:23:51,640 --> 00:23:52,720
My lady, you shouldn't drink anymore.

437
00:23:55,839 --> 00:23:57,000
I'm happy to.

438
00:23:57,440 --> 00:23:58,200
Mind your own business.

439
00:23:59,279 --> 00:24:00,680
Even if you're upset,

440
00:24:01,200 --> 00:24:03,119
you shouldn't risk your health.

441
00:24:05,759 --> 00:24:08,079
When you were at the pleasure house,

442
00:24:08,839 --> 00:24:11,000
did girls ever say this to you?

443
00:24:12,599 --> 00:24:13,559
To be honest,

444
00:24:14,160 --> 00:24:14,960
you know everything.

445
00:24:16,240 --> 00:24:16,720
Yes.

446
00:24:18,039 --> 00:24:19,279
I know everything.

447
00:24:19,960 --> 00:24:22,839
I know every candidate in the final round.

448
00:24:24,640 --> 00:24:25,440
But

449
00:24:27,440 --> 00:24:29,319
talent and ambition alone

450
00:24:31,160 --> 00:24:32,039
are useless.

451
00:24:34,799 --> 00:24:35,920
What do you mean?

452
00:24:38,640 --> 00:24:41,000
I want you to be the top of the Xingyun List.

453
00:24:46,039 --> 00:24:47,839
I want you to stay by my side.

454
00:24:51,759 --> 00:24:52,759
Cheng Qi is already married.

455
00:24:53,119 --> 00:24:55,559
And you are the daughter of the Grand Preceptor.

456
00:24:55,920 --> 00:24:57,359
I dare not be too bold.

457
00:25:01,440 --> 00:25:02,680
The escort agency is not for you.

458
00:25:02,880 --> 00:25:04,279
Neither is Su Yuejiao.

459
00:25:15,319 --> 00:25:17,160
Please drink more hot tea.

460
00:25:18,319 --> 00:25:19,160
Alcohol is bad for health.

461
00:25:20,400 --> 00:25:21,319
It's getting late.

462
00:25:22,440 --> 00:25:23,000
I

463
00:25:23,359 --> 00:25:24,440
have to leave.

464
00:25:25,079 --> 00:25:26,200
I'll drink with you another day.

465
00:25:46,319 --> 00:25:47,559
You're so outstanding.

466
00:25:48,519 --> 00:25:50,640
You deserve someone who loves you wholeheartedly.

467
00:26:14,279 --> 00:26:14,880
My Lord,

468
00:26:15,400 --> 00:26:16,839
I just wanna ask for my brothers.

469
00:26:17,240 --> 00:26:19,319
Are we sure to continue to be bandits?

470
00:26:19,799 --> 00:26:21,680
We haven't made any money for days.

471
00:26:22,359 --> 00:26:23,319
We are bandits.

472
00:26:24,880 --> 00:26:27,240
But you don't allow us to do anything.

473
00:26:27,599 --> 00:26:29,599
We haven't had a decent meal for a long time.

474
00:26:30,680 --> 00:26:32,039
Yeah.

475
00:26:32,640 --> 00:26:33,240
Why don't you

476
00:26:33,839 --> 00:26:35,000
take us to the Escort Agency?

477
00:26:36,039 --> 00:26:37,440
You said we would go there.

478
00:26:38,079 --> 00:26:38,759
You said

479
00:26:39,079 --> 00:26:39,880
the food there is good.

480
00:26:40,400 --> 00:26:41,039
and the beds

481
00:26:41,440 --> 00:26:42,279
are comfortable?

482
00:26:49,200 --> 00:26:50,000
Let's go to the city tomorrow.

483
00:26:50,519 --> 00:26:50,920
My Lord,

484
00:26:51,400 --> 00:26:52,240
you finally came to your senses.

485
00:26:52,839 --> 00:26:54,279
Even if it's manual labor,

486
00:26:54,519 --> 00:26:55,680
we can't let the brothers starve.

487
00:27:06,200 --> 00:27:07,440
Father, you wanted to see me?

488
00:27:12,279 --> 00:27:13,519
Let Qijia speak.

489
00:27:18,000 --> 00:27:18,480
Dad,

490
00:27:19,160 --> 00:27:20,480
she's really out of line now.

491
00:27:21,240 --> 00:27:22,480
I asked her to arrange a winner of the contest,

492
00:27:22,960 --> 00:27:24,000
but she kept putting it off.

493
00:27:24,599 --> 00:27:25,720
She didn't take me seriously at all.

494
00:27:31,039 --> 00:27:32,559
You want to arrange Ling Xingchen?

495
00:27:32,880 --> 00:27:33,880
You think he's suitable, right?

496
00:27:36,240 --> 00:27:37,799
He's a little weak,

497
00:27:37,839 --> 00:27:39,000
but his family background

498
00:27:39,319 --> 00:27:40,200
is good.

499
00:27:41,400 --> 00:27:42,079
Did you hear that?

500
00:27:42,839 --> 00:27:44,519
How dare she say that she's afraid of the emperor's anger?

501
00:27:45,000 --> 00:27:45,839
Who's she bluffing?

502
00:27:49,039 --> 00:27:50,680
Mr. Ling's poem

503
00:27:51,200 --> 00:27:52,440
must be written by someone else.

504
00:27:53,759 --> 00:27:55,720
I've managed to get him into the final round.

505
00:27:56,640 --> 00:27:58,279
As for who will win in the end,

506
00:27:58,799 --> 00:27:59,759
I dare not say.

507
00:28:00,720 --> 00:28:02,079
That's not what you said before.

508
00:28:02,480 --> 00:28:03,279
Enough.

509
00:28:05,319 --> 00:28:06,920
It's always good to be cautious.

510
00:28:07,920 --> 00:28:08,480
Yun,

511
00:28:08,960 --> 00:28:09,920
you may go now.

512
00:28:10,440 --> 00:28:11,319
Yes, father.

513
00:28:20,480 --> 00:28:21,519
You just

514
00:28:21,680 --> 00:28:22,880
can't keep a lid on it.

515
00:28:24,079 --> 00:28:25,279
You don't like to write,

516
00:28:25,640 --> 00:28:27,119
so she has to handle

517
00:28:27,359 --> 00:28:28,839
those things to please the official.

518
00:28:29,839 --> 00:28:30,920
But

519
00:28:31,119 --> 00:28:32,599
I've already promised Ling Feng.

520
00:28:33,200 --> 00:28:33,759
Besides,

521
00:28:34,279 --> 00:28:35,599
we need his connections.

522
00:28:36,440 --> 00:28:37,039
Enough.

523
00:28:37,559 --> 00:28:38,519
I know what I'm doing.

524
00:28:39,319 --> 00:28:40,880
Just focus on the Ministry of Works.

525
00:28:41,440 --> 00:28:42,400
Later,

526
00:28:42,519 --> 00:28:44,640
I'll recommend you to the Ministry of Civil Office.

527
00:28:45,200 --> 00:28:46,039
By then,

528
00:28:46,640 --> 00:28:47,880
those noble young men

529
00:28:48,519 --> 00:28:49,960
will be seeking your help.

530
00:28:51,039 --> 00:28:51,440
Okay.

531
00:28:52,000 --> 00:28:53,519
I won't let you down.

532
00:29:02,000 --> 00:29:03,079
Should I apply the powder first

533
00:29:03,519 --> 00:29:05,079
or rouge first?

534
00:29:12,079 --> 00:29:12,559
Whatever.

535
00:29:26,720 --> 00:29:28,240
Something's not right.

536
00:29:28,920 --> 00:29:29,839
Has it gone bad

537
00:29:30,559 --> 00:29:31,119
from sitting too long?

538
00:29:35,440 --> 00:29:36,880
My son-in-law, you're back.

539
00:29:53,720 --> 00:29:54,839
You... you...

540
00:29:55,279 --> 00:29:56,519
Didn't you go drinking with Grandpa?

541
00:29:56,880 --> 00:29:58,119
Why are you back so early?

542
00:29:58,720 --> 00:30:00,599
Grandpa went to the ancestral hall after a few drinks.

543
00:30:00,960 --> 00:30:02,440
I might as well come back and drink alone.

544
00:30:04,039 --> 00:30:05,039
Then drink more.

545
00:30:08,480 --> 00:30:10,039
What's wrong with you?

546
00:30:10,319 --> 00:30:11,079
Why are you crying?

547
00:30:12,200 --> 00:30:14,279
It's nothing. Just got dust in my eyes.

548
00:30:19,000 --> 00:30:20,000
You really cried.

549
00:30:20,440 --> 00:30:21,599
I should help you.

550
00:30:21,720 --> 00:30:22,640
Don't be so moved.

551
00:30:23,759 --> 00:30:24,039
Come on.

552
00:30:25,880 --> 00:30:26,240
My dear.

553
00:30:26,839 --> 00:30:27,400
My dear.

554
00:30:28,480 --> 00:30:28,880
My dear.

555
00:30:29,799 --> 00:30:30,079
You...

556
00:30:30,559 --> 00:30:30,839
You...

557
00:30:31,640 --> 00:30:32,759
Are you sick?

558
00:30:32,839 --> 00:30:33,799
Come on, let me take you to the doctor.

559
00:30:35,240 --> 00:30:35,680
Go.

560
00:30:37,519 --> 00:30:38,480
I'm fine.

561
00:30:38,920 --> 00:30:39,839
You didn't see anything.

562
00:30:41,799 --> 00:30:42,079
No.

563
00:30:49,599 --> 00:30:50,720
Why can't I wipe it off?

564
00:30:54,119 --> 00:30:54,599
My dear.

565
00:30:55,240 --> 00:30:56,039
Wait for me.

566
00:31:12,640 --> 00:31:13,160
Alright.

567
00:31:15,119 --> 00:31:16,839
Pigment from Pingjiang and powder from Guangling

568
00:31:17,240 --> 00:31:19,160
are hard to wash off.

569
00:31:19,920 --> 00:31:20,319
My lady,

570
00:31:21,039 --> 00:31:22,880
why do you suddenly use rouge?

571
00:31:24,640 --> 00:31:25,119
What's wrong?

572
00:31:25,680 --> 00:31:26,440
Can't I use it?

573
00:31:27,920 --> 00:31:29,279
Of course you can.

574
00:31:30,400 --> 00:31:32,400
But you can't use it when escorting.

575
